"}, "body": "はじめまして。\n素敵なイラストに惹かれ、ぜひ私と友人のOC（TRPGの探索者）を描いていただきたくリクエストさせていただきました。\n\n◆リクエスト内容\n・男性2人（恋人同士）\n・服や構図等はお任せいたします\n\n2人で楽しそうにデートしているところを描いていただきたいです。\nよく行く場所は以下ですが、それ以外でも大丈夫なので、描きやすいものを選んでいただければと思います。\n・水族館\n・喫茶店やカフェ（クリームソーダをよく頼みます）\n・公園で散歩\n・花屋\n\n◆キャラクターについて\nキャラ①\n・192cm/男性\n・黒髪の長髪\n・青の瞳\n・前髪中央が長い\n・イメージの花は紫陽花\n・動物で例えると犬\n\nキャラ②\n・170cm/男性\n・紫がかった黒髪の長髪\n・月白色の瞳（少し垂れ目）\n・左目尻に泣きぼくろ\n・イメージの花は彼岸花\n・動物で例えるとうさぎ\n\n▽資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PugZZ-qeQNcCK5mQNKCm1QdzSI6XVpu9?usp=drive_link\n\n◆用途\n・個人鑑賞（アイコンや壁紙利用）\n・友人への共有\n・個人利用の範囲での印刷\n\n依頼内容が金額と見合わない場合や不備がございましたら再送要請、キャンセルしていただけますと幸いです。\nぜひご縁がありましたらよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PugZZ-qeQNcCK5mQNKCm1QdzSI6XVpu9?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yoshikawa_04/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d0b1354/uploads/origins/bcb1de7c-1d80-4a28-9a35-322dc8535aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=38b2f94ff664f17767d5fc00ecabb536", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d0b1354/uploads/origins/bcb1de7c-1d80-4a28-9a35-322dc8535aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=38b2f94ff664f17767d5fc00ecabb536, https://si.imgix.net/0d0b1354/uploads/origins/bcb1de7c-1d80-4a28-9a35-322dc8535aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ccc53ceb5898ffa534300b15c8aa1362 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d0b1354/uploads/origins/bcb1de7c-1d80-4a28-9a35-322dc8535aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8d357e0dc938a746c503b902b3057746 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2629402, "nc": 17}, {"path": "/@yoshikawa_04/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2629402, "client_id": 882075, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bf9334de049be6b8cae743da39d1bf5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bf9334de049be6b8cae743da39d1bf5, https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0b18f5770429016c592603298b3dbfb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19c882f00e1095a98ad28b7596b3c4dd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50cdf244200ff13e2ecec0f0140bc083", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50cdf244200ff13e2ecec0f0140bc083, https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b010e69e4bdcef1bbb0f12bbf94a0111 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0fdca362/uploads/origins/2c137519-5677-4b79-be83-00ac1676716c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f8fc8e29a90b76411c883f35f6de9f15 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really love your art and would like to commission for my OC.\n\nOronia:\nA deer-spirit girl raised in the forest, Oronia now lives in Jade Town, working at the Black Cat Café. She has a passion for performance, collects clothes of all styles, and adores delicate, clear sounds like wind chimes and saxophones. Her gentle and reserved nature shifts to a lively, confident side in familiar settings, where her unique views shine through.\n\nYou have the freedom to design and create whatever you like!\nIf the amount is an issue, please feel free to suggest any changes.Thank you very much for your time and consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G-W1qVF6Nl8OnFQvaKQiFZuH9cuEp6L6?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yoshikawa_04/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2629402, "client_id": 3182809, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5df66947/uploads/origins/2f233af5-03cc-419d-a2dd-b00b058f3a03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93d76ddf01e60f0761c62a0c1369103a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5df66947/uploads/origins/2f233af5-03cc-419d-a2dd-b00b058f3a03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93d76ddf01e60f0761c62a0c1369103a, https://si.imgix.net/5df66947/uploads/origins/2f233af5-03cc-419d-a2dd-b00b058f3a03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66e10adbc133cb1154856838d30cf50e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5df66947/uploads/origins/2f233af5-03cc-419d-a2dd-b00b058f3a03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff64e2dd5e2fb59baa55d9fa4e6a95f1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls"